<title>UK: Verity hits fresh high on positive talk.</title>
<headline>Verity hits fresh high on positive talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Verity Group Plc climbed to fresh highs on Friday on positive comment by the Investor's Chronicle, market makers said.</p>
<p>Verity shares were up 3.0p at 50-1/2p by 1005 GMT.</p>
<p>&quot;The Investor's Chronicle wrote Verity up, and said keep buying at 43p,&quot; one trader said. &quot;But nothing goes up forever and I think it'll soon be back at the 40p level,&quot; the trader added.</p>
<p>-- Simon Gardner, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
